Definition 11.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"488–489"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"512–513"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-explicit-zero-arity-extension"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\geq1\">\\(m\\geq1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq0\">\\(n\\geq0\\)</span> 为整数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_r:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_r:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_r\\)</span> 与带标签语法构造见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m)\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m\">\\(Y=(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m)\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_{ij}\">\\(Y_{ij}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_i\">\\(Y_i\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个坐标。下式引入函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}\\)</span>，并引入后续方程使用的投影叶子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i^{(r)}\">\\(X_i^{(r)}\\)</span> 和常元叶子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_b^{(r)}\">\\(C_b^{(r)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 沿用该语法的单射元组编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_i^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\left\\langle1,\\{(a,a_i)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^r\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N^+,\\ i\\in[r]),\\qquad C_b^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N^+,\\ b\\in\\mathbb B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_i^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\left\\langle1,\\{(a,a_i)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^r\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N^+,\\ i\\in[r]),\\qquad C_b^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N^+,\\ b\\in\\mathbb B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\varphi): (\\mathbb B^n)^m\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad \\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\varphi)(Y)\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Eval}_m(\\varphi)(Y_{1j},\\ldots,Y_{mj})\\right)_{j\\in[n]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\varphi): (\\mathbb B^n)^m\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad \\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\varphi)(Y)\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Eval}_m(\\varphi)(Y_{1j},\\ldots,Y_{mj})\\right)_{j\\in[n]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,0}(\\varphi)\\big((\\varnothing)_{i\\in[m]}\\big)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,0}(\\varphi)\\big((\\varnothing)_{i\\in[m]}\\big)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：原书 Definition 11.1，印刷 pp.488–489／PDF pp.512–513。原定义先写 n≥1；PDF p.514 的函数替换语义明确允许 n≥0。本节点把空向量分支显式补出，属于保守的局部扩充。</p>\n<p>每个坐标都调用已存在的 BoolExpr 求值函数，因此输出存在、唯一且属于 Bⁿ；n=0 时只有空向量。X、C 是已定义语法树的叶子编码，X 不是向量变量自身。内层表达式的输入是 m 个布尔值，Lift 后的输入才是 m 个 n 维向量；两种元数不能交换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m\\geq1$、$n\\geq0$ 为整数；$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r$、$\\mathrm{Eval}_r:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_r$ 与带标签语法构造见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m$，$Y=(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m)\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$；$Y_{ij}$ 表示 $Y_i$ 的第 $j$ 个坐标。下式引入函数 $\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$，并引入后续方程使用的投影叶子 $X_i^{(r)}$ 和常元叶子 $C_b^{(r)}$；$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$ 沿用该语法的单射元组编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_r:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m","display":false},{"tex":"Y=(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m)\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m","display":false},{"tex":"Y_{ij}","display":false},{"tex":"Y_i","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"X_i^{(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"C_b^{(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X_i^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\left\\langle1,\\{(a,a_i)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^r\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N^+,\\ i\\in[r]),\\qquad C_b^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N^+,\\ b\\in\\mathbb B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\varphi): (\\mathbb B^n)^m\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad \\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\varphi)(Y)\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Eval}_m(\\varphi)(Y_{1j},\\ldots,Y_{mj})\\right)_{j\\in[n]}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,0}(\\varphi)\\big((\\varnothing)_{i\\in[m]}\\big)=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":2431,"backlinks":[{"id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,s\\geq1$、$n\\geq0$ 为整数；$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r$、$\\mathrm{Eval}_r$ 与 $\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$ 见 [[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]。$h\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_s$；有限序列 $\\tau\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m^{[s]}$ 的第 $i$ 项记作 $\\tau_i$。取 $f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$；$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$ 是单射元组编码。$e=\\langle m,p,q\\rangle$ 时，$p,q\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m$ 是等式左右两侧的语法对象，其载体由下式构造。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-vectorinterpretation|df-vectorinterpretation — Componentwise interpretation of a Boolean expression]]"},{"id":"1d6715331cf48592","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b2aa62f1a3d9ec85","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$；$\\mathrm{EqDef}_+$、$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$、$\\mathrm{Id}_r$、$\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]；$\\models_n$、$\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$ 分别见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]、[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]。"}],"outgoing":["f3101a1c9df92f67"]}